What is an Equipment Lease Agreement?
An Equipment Lease Agreement is a legal contract that sets out the rental terms between:
✔ The equipment owner (lessor)
✔ The equipment user (lessee)
This agreement clearly defines:
•	Rental payments
•	Lease duration
•	Responsibilities for repairs
•	Liability and risk
•	Ownership rights
